    "entryID": 31,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "前面人影竄動，應是賊寇埋伏。\n小心避開為上。",
    "Sequence": "PlayOrStopParticle(SecretSpot,Play);\nShowInstantMessage(Exp_FeatExp,MC1,Insight,20)@2;\nShowInstantMessage(Check,Insight,Success)@2.2;\nSetPortrait(MC1,pic=3);\nEnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1,Surprise_2);",
    "Conditions": "IsPassDice()  == true",
    "zh_TW": "前面人影竄動，應是賊寇埋伏。\n小心避開為上。",
    "zh_CN": "前面人影窜动，应是贼寇埋伏。 \n小心避开为上。",
    "links": [38]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 32,
    "actorID": "role57",
    "text": "此路我開，想過路──留財！否則，留命！",
    "Sequence": "ShowInstantMessage(Check,Insight,Fail);",
    "Conditions": "IsPassDice()  == false and (IsFameValuePass(\"MC1\", 2000)  == false)",
    "zh_TW": "此路我開，想過路──留財！否則，留命！",
    "zh_CN": "此路我开，想过路──留财！否则，留命！",
    "links": [33, 34, 35, 36]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 33,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "1.[em1][口才][/em1]我看你實為好漢，既是好漢，何苦為難討生活的人呢？",
    "Sequence": "BeginDiceRoll(Persuasion,Manual,10);\nSetContinueMode(false);\nSetContinueMode(original)@Message(EndRoll);\nContinue()@Message(EndRoll)",
    "zh_TW": "1.[em1][口才][/em1]我看你實為好漢，既是好漢，何苦為難討生活的人呢？",
    "zh_CN": "1.[em1][口才][/em1]我看你实为好汉，既是好汉，何苦为难讨生活的人呢？",
    "links": [266]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 34,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "2.[em1][政治][/em1]有道是做人留一線，日後好相見，多一位朋友，總好多一位敵人，你說是吧？",
    "Sequence": "BeginDiceRoll(Politics,Manual,10);\nSetContinueMode(false);\nSetContinueMode(original)@Message(EndRoll);\nContinue()@Message(EndRoll)",
    "zh_TW": "2.[em1][政治][/em1]有道是做人留一線，日後好相見，多一位朋友，總好多一位敵人，你說是吧？",
    "zh_CN": "2.[em1][政治][/em1]有道是做人留一线，日后好相见，多一位朋友，总好多一位敌人，你说是吧？",
    "links": [269]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 35,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "3.[em1][威嚇][/em1]生死看淡，不服來戰。",
    "Sequence": "BeginDiceRoll(Intimidation,Manual,10);\nSetContinueMode(false);\nSetContinueMode(original)@Message(EndRoll);\nContinue()@Message(EndRoll)",
    "zh_TW": "3.[em1][威嚇][/em1]生死看淡，不服來戰。",
    "zh_CN": "3.[em1][威吓][/em1]生死看淡，不服来战。",
    "links": [272]
  },
